'''The Fracturing Spinner''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Blunt Arrow Quiver}}.

==Modifiers==
{{c|mod|Grants Summon Harbinger of Directions Skill}}: Summons an immortal [[Harbinger]] minion. The [[minion]] will cast a random [[buff]] on you that grants one or all of the following:
*1 additional Projectile 
*+1 Chain
*Pierce 1 additional Target
*Projectiles Fork. 

See {{sl|Summon Harbinger of Directions}} for more information.

{{Item acquisition}}

When the last piece is placed, they will all vanish, and the player will be left with the forged item.

